  Scenario: A request that names a seat that cannot be held is refused with SEAT_UNAVAILABLE, listing that seat
    When I run "create_hold" with:
      | idempotency_key | event_id                             | hold_lines                                                                                                                                                                        | caller                                       | called_at            |
